Z||000001||Carrolles||07-13-99||07:04 AM||||On the Muncie 4spd the same happens with 3rd/4th shifting when the shift linkage lever (where the shift cables meet the trans) at the transmission gets worn.  I know that Rodney Dickman makes very nice replacement levers for the 5spd Getrag.  You might take a look at this before you tear into the transmission.<p>Hope this helps,<br>Carroll
