Z||000004||Bruce||07-13-99||04:36 PM||||Visceral,<br>Check "Transaxle/Clutch" thread in this forum, 6/30/99. I had a similar problem going from 2nd to 3rd in my 4 speed. I followed the suggestions regarding the linkage pins, and my problem was solved.<br>Good luck!
Z||000005||VISCERAL||07-15-99||01:47 PM||||thanks for the advice. I'll try it soon
Z||000006||PaUL||07-15-99||03:19 PM||||It could be that your clutch is not releasing completely, a common fiero problem most likely due to a bad slave cylinder. 
